invariant: INV-38
file: io.c
catches: unit
reason: io_read_record refuses a length field over 2^14 + 256 bytes
  with decode_error, the alert every caller sent before
  https://github.com/c4milo/chapulin/issues/207, where RFC 9846 §5.2
  requires record_overflow. bin/unit reads a header of 2^14 + 257 bytes and
  requires record_overflow.

--- old
    if (body > 0x4000 + 256) {
        *alert = ALERT_RECORD_OVERFLOW;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    if (body > 0x4000 + 256) {
        *alert = ALERT_DECODE_ERROR;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
